 ],
 "notes": "Port rules accept inline default-SG rules or separate rule resources; HTTP/HTTPS/SSH rules must be TCP so an all-protocol rule does not stand in for them. 'Only from within the VPC CIDR' requires every ingress CIDR to be the VPC CIDR; the separate-rule branches cannot see inline default-SG rules, so a template mixing inline and separate rules is judged on the separate ones (rare in Terraform, where the two styles conflict)."
